        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nShe specifically asked you to be honest. Honoring that request\u2014while being gentle about delivery and perhaps adding \"and here's what I'd want to see before I'd support you quitting\" or \"maybe don't give your notice tomorrow, but give yourself a deadline to sell a piece first\"\u2014is more respectful of her as an adult than a cozy lie. A small, kind truth lets her make a fully informed decision about her own financial future.",
          "refusal": null,
